# Rule: high_tool_call_rate
# Category: DoS / Runaway Agent Protection
# Severity: high
# Attack Class: dos
#
# Detects agents making an excessive number of tool calls in a short window.
# This may indicate a runaway agent stuck in a loop, a prompt injection causing
# repeated tool invocations, or an intentional denial-of-service attack.
#
# Threshold: more than 100 tool calls within a 60-second sliding window.
# Tune this per environment — legitimate data-processing agents may hit higher rates.

event.type == "TOOL_CALL" AND count("TOOL_CALL", "60s") > 100
